# data/ holds large intermediates that are cheap to refetch, so it stays out of
# the repo — EXCEPT the handful of inputs build_timeseries.py cannot rebuild on
# its own. Without those committed, a fresh checkout (i.e. every GitHub Actions
# run) fails at load_nhgis(), because the NHGIS crosswalk needs an IPUMS API key
# and an async extract, and the clip mask is assembled from several TIGER
# downloads that are not part of the refresh chain.
data/*
!data/tracts_2010_34.zip
!data/tracts_2010_36.zip
!data/clip_mask.geojson
!data/normalized_counts.json
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
